        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vikram Seth\n- Works: A Suitable Boy, A Suitable Girl, Mappings, Beastly Tales\n- Topics: Indian English-language poetry\n\nFacts:\n- Vikram Seth was born on June 20, 1952.\n- Vikram Seth is an Indian novelist and poet.\n- Vikram Seth wrote the poetry collections \"Mappings\" and \"Beastly Tales\".\n- \"Mappings\" and \"Beastly Tales\" are notable contributions to the Indian English-language poetry canon.\n- A sequel to \"A Suitable Boy\" titled \"A Suitable Girl\" was due for publication in 2017.",
